data: {"id": "91130d53c767484e-thinking-parallel_evidence-1163", "run_id": "91130d53c767484e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态（`kubectl get pod -o yaml`）**\n- `phase: Running`：当前 Kubernetes 阶段为 **Running**，并非 Terminating。\n- `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T07:52:27Z`：**已存在**，说明删除请求已发出。\n- `deletionGracePeriodSeconds: 3900`（65 分钟）：删除宽限期极长。\n- `finalizers: <none>`：**无 finalizer**，排除了 finalizer 阻止删除的可能。\n- `nodeName: node2`：调度在 node2。\n- `containerStatuses.app: ready=True, restarts=0`：容器仍在运行、未崩溃重启。\n\n**2. 事件（`kubectl events`）**\n- 42s ago: `Warning Unhealthy` — Readiness probe 超时。\n- 40s ago: `Normal Killing", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789368504935, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

