data: {"id": "91130d53c767484e-final", "run_id": "91130d53c767484e", "seq": 1168, "ts_ms": 1789368519852, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v13/workload` | Terminating | Pod 的删除请求已触发，但应用代码中包含阻塞式优雅终止逻辑（循环检查 /state/teardown-requested 文件是否存在），由于该文件未被外部创建，导致容器进程持续运行以等待宽限期耗尽，而非 Kubernetes 资源或 Finalizer 异常。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod | phase: Running | 确认容器当前处于运行中状态，而非已停止或崩溃 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Pod | diagnosis: 阻塞式优雅终止逻辑 | 直接提供应用层面的终止行为描述 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 2026-09-14T06:47:28.436Z SIGTERM received; waiting | 确认应用已收到 SIGTERM 信号并开始等待 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 2026-09-14T06:47:26.305Z application started | 确认应用生命周期起始时间，结合上一日志确认进程存活 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 状态证实 Pod 处于 `Running` 阶段且 `restart_count` 为 0，排除 CrashLoopBackOff 等异常。日志维度提供了决定性证据：应用进程捕获到 `SIGTERM` 信号后打印了 `waiting` 信息，这与应用正在执行优雅停机逻辑（如检查文件、等待连接断开）的行为特征一致，表明进程未因错误退出，而是按预期（或设计）进入了阻塞等待状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n外部发起 Pod 删除 → SIGTERM 信号发送 → 应用捕获信号并等待终止条件 → 终止条件（文件）不存在导致持续循环\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod 的优雅终止逻辑存在设计上的阻塞行为。具体而言，当 Kubernetes 发起删除请求并发出 SIGTERM 信号时，应用代码并未正常退出，而是进入了一个 `while` 循环，持续检查 `/state/teardown-requested` 文件是否存在（见证据 #2、#3）。由于该特定文件未被外部创建，循环条件永远无法满足，导致容器进程无法响应退出指令，表现为长时间处于 `Running` 状态以等待系统强制的终止宽限期耗尽。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 42.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v13/workload: 42.7s (Evidence 34.7s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 6.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v13/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 66.299, "metrics": {"run_id": "91130d53c767484e", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 66.30206489562988, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 66302.06489562988, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 62910.40062904358, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7453.287839889526, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3012.8889083862305}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16721.76504135132, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 42660.11738777161, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 6894.237756729126, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

